    "preamble": "And Another vs Union Of India And Others on 8 March, 2024 D/L.30. March 8, 2024. Mns. Wpa No. 28958 of 2022 + Can 1 of 2023 M/s. Mokalbari Kanoi Tea Estate Pvt. Ltd. and another Vs. Union of India and others Mr. N. K. Chowdhury, Mr. Arijit Chakraborti, Mr. Nilotpal Chowdhury, Mr. Deepak Sharma ... for the petitioners. Mr. Mr. K. K. Maiti",
    "facts": "Re: Can 1 of 2023 (modification) 1. The Food Safety and Standard Authority of India (Fssai) has filed the present modification application for modifying/clarifying the order dated September 5, 2023 passed in Wpa No. 28958 of 2022.",
    "arguments": "5. Upon hearing learned counsel for the parties, it transpires that the issue sought to be raised in the modification application has already been decided conclusively in the writ petition itself."
  },
